cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use RELIC in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "RELIC: Behavioral Contract Analysis for JCL Batch Modernization"
abstract: >
  RELIC recovers implicit behavioral obligations (TEMPORAL, RESOURCE, CONTROL_FLOW)
  from JCL batch jobs as a Behavioral Contract Graph and reports contracts that a
  changed job breaks or weakens. Version 1.1.0 replaces the earlier, circular
  evaluation (its results are withdrawn) with a source-level mutation benchmark
  over three public JCL corpora, labelled by an independent JCL execution-semantics
  oracle. Current results: results/final/metrics.json and docs/evaluation/RESULTS.md.
authors:
